abstract: >-
  Controlled evaluation-regime experiments for two population-graph
  implementations (EV-GCN, Parisot-GCN) on ABIDE-I: the P0/P1
  training-time cohort-visibility intervention on three preselected outer
  splits, with the frozen results, per-subject out-of-fold registry and
  deterministic reproduction scripts. Data are not redistributed.
